OL,3,GNEWSAAcun Ilicali: The game player
OL,4,Ataking Hull City into the Premier
OL,5,ALeague
OL,6,
OL,7,FHull City owner Acun Ilicali is
OL,8,Fpreparing for the club's return to the
OL,9,FPremier League, the latest milestone in
OL,10,Fa life that has taken him from
OL,11,Fbankruptcy and personal tragedy to
OL,12,Ftelevision stardom.
OL,14,FDubbed Turkey's Simon Cowell, Ilicali
OL,15,Fhas become one of the most recognisable
OL,16,Ffigures in his home country, a rise
OL,17,Fthat might once have seemed unlikely
OL,18,Fafter he was declared bankrupt in his
OL,19,Ftwenties.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
