OL,3,GNEWSAAcun Ilicali: The game player
OL,4,Ataking Hull City into the Premier
OL,5,ALeague
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow, as Hull prepare for their first
OL,8,Fseason back in the top flight since he
OL,9,Fbought the club in 2022, he says he is
OL,10,Fapproaching the challenge with the same
OL,11,Fdetermination that has defined much of
OL,12,Fhis life.
OL,14,FOn the streets of his home city of
OL,15,FIstanbul, he cannot go anywhere without
OL,16,Fbeing recognised and asked for a
OL,17,Fpicture or a few moments of his time.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
